          %p
            An original account is (
            %a{:href => "#Lewis86"}> Lewis 86
            ). The following is the approach due to (
            %a{:href => "#Joyal08"}> Joyal 08
            ), in the generality of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/parameterized+spectra"} parameterized spectra
            (which happens to make the analysis easier instead of harder).
